 fighter if that sounds up your street  it's available on pc  developer raven software's star wars  jedi knight 2 jedi outcast is the third  game in the jedi knight series which  began with 1995's dark forces the series  follows kyle katan a mercenary turned  jedi who briefly embraces the dark side  and can use all manner of force  abilities in jedi outcast kyle has  forsaken the force only to learn that he  needs to reconnect with his force  sensitivity in order to combat a threat  posed to the new republic jedi outcast  is the point in the jedi knight series  where combat fully transitions to a  hybrid of shooter and lightsaber combat  that along with the really good single  player campaign makes jedi outcast the  best of the jedi knight games it also  sees kyle meet with several popular star  wars characters like luke skywalker and  lando calrissian providing a look at  their lives admittedly a look that is no  longer canon after the events of return  of the jedi jedi outcast is available  for ps4 switch xbox gamecube and pc  bioware austin's star wars the old  republic has come a long way since its  launch in 2011. this mmorpg is still  kicking with a thriving player base and  eight major content expansions taking  place hundreds of years after the events  of star wars knights of the old republic  the old republic allows you to play  through eight distinct storylines during  the ongoing conflict between the sith  empire and galactic republic each  storyline sees you recruiting different  squad mates responding to different  moral based dialogue choices wielding  different weapons and abilities meeting  different characters and having the  chance to fall in love with different  romance options so you basically have  eight different story-driven rpgs here  all of which feature missions you can  tackle alongside well-written npc  companions or real-world players star  wars the old republic is available for  pc  tt games lego star wars the skywalker  saga is a charming and really fun way to  once again experience the star wars  movies lego star wars has certainly  evolved from the original game and lego  star wars the skywalker saga features  cover based shooting multiple hubs that  exist as separate open worlds and huge  star fighter battles fans who know star  wars inside and out can find much to  enjoy in each game including callbacks  easter eggs and characters to play as  galore lego star wars the skywalker saga  is available on pc switch ps4 and 5 xbox  one and xbox series  developer dice's star wars battlefront 2  which is not to be confused with  pandemic studios 2005 game star wars  battlefront 2 made an extremely rough  first impression in 2017. there aren't  that many games that can claim to have a  microtransaction controversy prior to  their official launch on par with this  one but to the credit of dice and  support studios criterion and motive  battlefront 2 got substantial post  launch content balancing updates bug  fixes and most importantly adjustments  to how the in-game economy works it's  now a rewarding game to play with a  decent but not fantastic single-player  campaign about an elite galactic empire  special forces trooper defecting to the  new republic but it does have an  expansive online multiplayer experience  with plenty of awesome modes to play  star wars battlefront 2 is available for  xbox one ps4 and pc  now there are very few moments in star  wars that capture how terrifying darth  vader is the final moments of rogue one  a star wars story his few appearances in  star wars rebels season 2 and his  adventures in kieran gill and star wars  darth vader are certainly the standouts  but that overwhelming sense of fear that  many feel when standing in darth vader's  presence wasn't fully realized within  video games until  vader immortal a star wars vr series you  don't quite realize just how imposingly  tall and intimidating vader is until  he's looming over you and threatening  your life you have acquitted yourself  well  i will not be denied  you will help seize the bright star the  game's story takes place in between  revenge of the sith and rogue one seeing  you play as a smuggler who gets caught  up in darth vader's attempts to bring  padme amidala back to life vader  immortal a star wars vr series is  available for oculus quest oculus rift  and psvr  respawn entertainment star wars jedi  fallen order is an action-adventure game  that incorporates a sakuro shadows die  twice-like parry system for its  lightsaber combat and takes inspiration  from both metroidvania and souls-like  games for its exploration and  progression taking place after revenge  of the sith fallen order sees you play  as jedi padawan turned scrapper  calcastus who goes on the run when  imperial inquisitors start hunting him  fallen order digs deep into some of the  themes only glossed over in other star  wars media such as understanding  yourself enough to fight against your  own darkness and knowing how and when to  ask for help when tackling overwhelming  adversity there's some excellent  storytelling going on when cal meets  night sister merrin and the two try to  broach common ground through the trauma  of watching their respective orders fall  star wars jedi fallen order is available  for xbox series xns xbox one ps5 ps4 pc  and stadia what would jaro te paul say  you have no right to mention his name i  wonder  what would he think if he could see his  padawan now  skulking in the shadows with a betrayer  motif studio's star wars squadrons is  fantastic though the game's  single-player campaign which sees you  alternate between the newest members of  the new republic's vanguard squadron and  the galactic empire's titan squadron  following the events of return of the  jedi isn't very good beyond acting as a  decent story driven tutorial online  multiplayer is a blast to play matches  put you into fast pace 5v5 dogfights  where communicating with your team and  managing how much 